sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant A as Public ALB
    participant E as ECS edge API
    participant R as Redis
    participant K as Private EKS user API
    participant D as Relational database
    participant Q as SQS analytics queue
    participant W as Analytics worker
    B->>A: Profile read or update + traceparent
    A->>E: Route API request
    E->>R: Read scoped cache key
    alt Cache hit
        R-->>E: Current representation
        E-->>B: Fast response + request ID
    else Miss or write
        R-->>E: Miss or bounded timeout
        E->>K: Private domain request
        K->>D: Reader or writer operation
        D-->>K: Domain result
        K-->>E: Authorized result
        E->>R: Best-effort TTL fill
        E-->>B: Response + request ID
    end
    E->>Q: Commit job event after business write
    Q->>W: Deliver event
    W-->>B: Job status becomes complete
    Note over E,W: Trace context linked, job identity remains job_id
